;; safeload.art — running the file that hangs the interpreter.
;;
;; bugs slash comment-lexer-hang.art cannot be run or imported: its
;; comment contains a backslash-dash and the 0.10.0 lexer never
;; returns. loadSafe reads it as a raw string, strips the comments
;; with a Carpintero grammar before any lexing happens, and hands the
;; clean source to the lexer — the package fixing the language with
;; its own dialect.

import ./"../carpintero.art"!

print "loading the file that hangs the interpreter..."
discard do loadSafe ./"../bugs/comment-lexer-hang.art"
print "loaded and executed. it printed its own line above."
